    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4657ae0e337ccd25ce19704",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋川理事长",
      "source_fingerprint": "610762d94d7d1f35bbf866cd6d6c8f5d78f090737bc26dcba88e358dac124ab3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7de1f9c775e375ab87920181",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……………呜！　妈妈……！！\n真的，真的是你……！\n啊……呜呜啊啊啊啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "baa4b827ea3d493c8116de099438585ecd90e27520c6894dd55a17be3254d79b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06bcc29b2f935d81ba92e7c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋川理事长哭了出来，与母亲相拥。\n大家悄悄离开，留下时间让母女团聚――",
      "source_fingerprint": "6687c5c0e6bc1e49b19f4626a8a5175d383357481f55fddabcb1128e979c86a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a36189f86780710fba7e90fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以前也听说过，秋川理事长的『母亲』――\n是特雷森学园前任理事长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c12448212f1d6af8d1d769eb2c0b7d0cd4a3e8326270e97c92d64c9782e6dbad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9780115b347df008869c6537",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "似乎是因为其超众的才能，各国强烈希望她能\n为全世界赛马娘尽一份力，\n所以就退下理事长的位子，去到了国外工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e925f569873b38a0557e1d6ee9644d550c93de8c3504dffda202291412b39298",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfc47e3ce9592d5bb744af64",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "诶，只有3个小时吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2586bf1d3ee82c6f50bd79d51c54f35f9b06e0f859ed6387e9c53df92edd6301",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c9b051faccb79f88a9d3abf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋川理事长",
      "source_fingerprint": "610762d94d7d1f35bbf866cd6d6c8f5d78f090737bc26dcba88e358dac124ab3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
