    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e91b9547507218dacf19c3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这一次，好像因为飞机的换乘\n会在日本待3个小时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d637d9bbac9ee3dd13b0ca971e427e78a1c3d3cb3f66943a732891b967eaf67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a633807b76e26bb136276a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋川理事长",
      "source_fingerprint": "610762d94d7d1f35bbf866cd6d6c8f5d78f090737bc26dcba88e358dac124ab3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf7c4a346a526e0d792ecec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错！　妈妈要去帮助全世界的赛马娘。\n之前去南美和大洋洲的时候，\n都没回过一次日本。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a35af9e36e761e8cb864305c93d57e9a0fee32cfae2a4d3354c52dfa2767b17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8235532da2aee331247cc12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋川理事长",
      "source_fingerprint": "610762d94d7d1f35bbf866cd6d6c8f5d78f090737bc26dcba88e358dac124ab3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf78f2c71e08ff42bbe78a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次妈妈，会在日本待3个小时。\n……真是难得的机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e3eb4454cce4b019374501184d911387f9caa7afe1dc891a32774870d14f729",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5062e184a79aadb490172e4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "理事长，那是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b490df80611673030f2fcfec3f389ff052bce2c4d12540b60ac0a88ef1b508f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0e168a330ca47bd876d4951",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋川理事长",
      "source_fingerprint": "610762d94d7d1f35bbf866cd6d6c8f5d78f090737bc26dcba88e358dac124ab3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d4471b118f10b852713282e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此这次见面，\n我想给妈妈展示一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b4af165cd84621de28263f93e2e01125b9a17a625948822a9451ff4d3ea2c38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f41e46bcf88c225c217410e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "邂逅！同一片天空下",
      "source_fingerprint": "1100cefbf03f168c9d698ece079a8293977a0e34f20df05d31f96d05016ebe9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002008.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d17421da8f9135fd23ab8405",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与<chrname>的三年时光\n暂时告一段落的某天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e22c999ba2cc55653ce8f5fb24e83c138563549a2eaf7e79af8cdcbf1c794f65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/80/9002/storytimeline_809002009.json",
      "json_path": [
